{"detail": {"templateUuid": "0ceee23ad1a04af797580e64155c020f", "projectUuid": "142987143285418490aafcf05338d82d", "name": "《梦想启程——昆明理工大学奇幻世界》", "description": "以“每一种热爱，都有属于自己的世界”为创作理念，以新生入学为故事主线，采用电影级CG动画与皮克斯风格视觉表现，构建兼具科技感、艺术感与奇幻色彩的“昆工宇宙”。作品突破传统校园宣传片的叙事方式，将学校三十余个学院转化为风格各异的奇幻世界，结合学院学科特色设计专属建筑、交通方式、学习场景与生活空间，通过沉浸式冒险旅程展现昆明理工大学多元融合、开放创新的育人环境。作品融合云南地域文化、未来科技与青春成长元素，以富有想象力的视觉语言诠释校园文化，塑造具有持续延展性的校园IP形象，向每一位即将踏入昆工的新生传递探索未知、追逐梦想、勇于创新的精神内涵，展现新时代高校开放包容、创新发展的校园魅力。", "coverUrl": "/assets/1ece8a35601c0ea4.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/b6b559a0fa6e4c0d9966af6dcf821932/874076d00176ffb96cb46dc87851ab308f3d4f39.mp4", "snapshotId": 25050, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 4233007, "ownerUuid": "b6b559a0fa6e4c0d9966af6dcf821932", "avatar": "/assets/7fb00838edf0864d.webp", "nickname": "子言sunshine", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 2, "tags": [{"id": 1106, "code": "corporate", "tagLabel": "企业宣传", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1106/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 6, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1303, "code": "short_animation", "tagLabel": "动画短片", "parentTag": 1300, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1300/1303/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 3, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "createAt": "2026年07月07日 23:45", "updateAt": "2026年07月08日 21:42", "publishAt": "2026年07月07日 23:45", "playCount": 2, "viewCreationProcessCount": 0, "copyCanvasCount": 0, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/0ceee23ad1a04af797580e64155c020f.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 169, "edges": 274}}, "recommendList": []}